            <div xml:id="d289">

                <pb facs="0356" n="272" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg272"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 371.11/220</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berne</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-12-22T17:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 22, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received December 21, 4.30
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2289. Department’s 1227, December 15, 5 p.m.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d289-f1"/>
                    Spanish Embassy, Berlin, wires as follows: <pb facs="0357" n="273"
                        xml:id="pg273"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>German Government informs me, in note just received, that their
                            Liquidation of American oil properties in Roumania has not yet been
                            effected but that this liquidation will be effected surely in the event
                            of news of the liquidation of German properties in the United
                            States.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
